{"id":"e3p0aemnlvfw3evae9d53my8f","title":"智慧树云 computing ETF (WCLD) 运作概览","originalTitle":"WCLD: Equal-Weight ETF In Cloud Computing","summary":"智慧树云 computing ETF (WCLD) 于2019年9月6日推出，追踪BVP纳斯达克新兴云指数，管理资产3.04亿美元，日均成交量2700万美元。WCLD采用等权重指数，覆盖64家美国上市的云业务公司，费用比率为0.45%。尽管WCLD在过去一年表现落后于标普科技精选行业SPDR ETF (XLK)，但其等权重策略使其在高波动性中保持较低的公司特定风险。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4968000-wcld-equal-weight-etf-in-cloud-computing?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T21:30:58.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T21:38:16.652Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T21:38:16.652Z","category":"crypto-market","tags":["研究报告","ETF"],"score":41,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"8e4b63df-f3ab-4e93-be37-6e777718e8cf","title":"WCLD等权重ETF策略及费用对比分析"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"8e4b63df-f3ab-4e93-be37-6e777718e8cf","title":"WCLD等权重ETF策略及费用对比分析"}],"topics":[{"slug":"etf","name":"加密 ETF"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fiKVU1_GSZ9g","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}